  "title": "Healthier Chicken Pot Pie",
  "description": "This healthier chicken pot pie recipe relies on a whole wheat crust, lean chicken, more vegetables, low-fat milk, and broth instead of canned soup.",
  "authors": [
    "MakeItHealthy"
  ],
