  "ingredients": [
    "2 (9 inch) unbaked whole wheat pie crust",
    "1 pound skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cubed",
    "1.5 cups sliced carrots",
    "1 cup frozen green peas",
    "0.5 cup sliced celery",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup chopped onion",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon celery seed",
    "1.75 cups chicken broth",
    "0.66666668653488 cup low-fat (1%) milk",
    "0.25 cup chopped Italian parsley"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Press 1 pastry crust into a 9-inch pie plate; refrigerate along with second pastry crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/__-tSoqIfrtiwn6DGCGkpOQ8bBU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-01-410fde6e80514fd1903a77c6d77a07bd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine chicken, carrots, green peas, and celery in a medium saucepan; cover with water. Boil until chicken is no longer pink in centers and vegetables are fork-tender, about 15 minutes. Remove from heat, drain, and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cLBN8-RhAsw8DaBCVPCTH_74Dzs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-02-a8240b79931046f38b6d78d020e9362d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a separate medium saucepan over medium heat. Add onion; cook until soft and translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir in flour, salt, black pepper, and celery seeds; slowly stir in chicken broth and milk. Simmer over medium-low heat until thick, about 5 minutes. Stir in parsley. Remove from heat and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a1uhwHvim4iBkXU4q3ugOxlb6ec=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-03-700f62c2d10a4b02bbdf3be620a46387.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken mixture to crust in pie plate; pour broth mixture over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fRYElDdNXONJHdbCjHci3RGdsWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-04-31046f1990b940468ae27c8e4e329bed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover pie with remaining pastry crust. Seal edges and cut away excess dough. Make several small slits on top to allow steam to escape.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ilRCCmzNdWqtYpxOs6-mGuIVtII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-05-3e57612d05814ff0850c6bb5b8a34ce1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until pie is golden brown and filling is bubbly, 30 to 35 minutes. Cool before serving for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lzy6UglzFR4uzwgID14k_1-08CA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222131-healthier-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-step-06-fad1eb727ab44d7da2d91c66ff4c38c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222131/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
